1
00:00:00,970 --> 00:00:02,640
(Bernadette:)That was ten years ago.

2
00:00:03,106 --> 00:00:05,446
(Sheldon:)Nine years, 11 months
and three weeks ago,

3
00:00:05,608 --> 00:00:08,488
(Sheldon:)he followed that up by replacing
the slides for my lecture

4
00:00:08,644 --> 00:00:11,484
(Sheldon:)with photographs
of nude fat women bending over.

5
00:00:14,083 --> 00:00:15,083
(Amy:)Really?

6
00:00:15,251 --> 00:00:16,891
(Howard:)The lecture was on
cosmic gas clouds.

7
00:00:16,886 --> 00:00:18,486
That's funny!

8
00:00:20,323 --> 00:00:22,273
(Raj:)I was there. It was funny.

9
00:00:26,896 --> 00:00:29,846
(Sheldon:)In any event, that began
a decade-long progression

10
00:00:29,999 --> 00:00:33,639
(Sheldon:)of insults, pranks and
unwanted magazine subscriptions.

11
00:00:34,170 --> 00:00:35,980
(Sheldon:)To this day,
I still get a monthly copy

12
00:00:36,139 --> 00:00:37,849
(Sheldon:)of Granny on Granny.

13
00:00:39,809 --> 00:00:41,519
(Sheldon:)Which, other than its
surprisingly fun puzzle page,

14
00:00:41,677 --> 00:00:42,817
(Sheldon:)is complete filth.

15
00:00:46,949 --> 00:00:48,659
(Amy:)Thanks for walking me
to my car.

16
00:00:49,352 --> 00:00:50,922
(Raj:)Actually, it's for both of us.

17
00:00:51,087 --> 00:00:52,497
(Raj:)Last night, I watched
West Side Story,

18
00:00:52,655 --> 00:00:54,535
(Raj:)and I'm a little freaked out
by street gangs.

19
00:00:56,425 --> 00:01:01,025
(Amy:)Why can't Raj find a girl?
The mystery continues.

